{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hoop Fighters</strong> is a multiplayer and <strong>rule-free party basketball game</strong> with cartoon graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can beat up your friends or other players while making scores in lobbies which you can create up to 6 people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.poster.avif?t=1766132216\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.webm?t=1766132216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/6bdabfe31188766b35925473c8b769fc.mp4?t=1766132216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can punch, slide or even throw objects around your opponent to get the ball. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to run to the ball again after scoring because <strong><i>the game never stops!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b0b682e8d56251911ee8460ddc9f0849.poster.avif?t=1766132216\" width=480 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b0b682e8d56251911ee8460ddc9f0849.webm?t=1766132216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b0b682e8d56251911ee8460ddc9f0849.mp4?t=1766132216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take your place in the most unregulated and funny basketball game to show off your basketball skills, have unlimited fun and beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.poster.avif?t=1766132216\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.webm?t=1766132216\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/extras/b484870e366ff0585c0cb37f44d0e3aa.mp4?t=1766132216\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character that reflects your mood best and jump onto the court.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2244520?t=1766132216","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766132216","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/1c57ca5c30146a8bd766ac3d8789a36d2aa7bced/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766132216","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2244520/1c57ca5c30146a8bd766ac3d8789a36d2aa7bced/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766132216","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing",